# Dev-only test deps (see handoff/package.json) — the game itself has none
node_modules
handoff/v-*.png
handoff/*.png

# Working exports — regenerate with `import_questions.py --export`.
# A stale copy committed here is a silent revert waiting to happen: the pool has
# been 46, 63, 68 and 104 questions, and importing an old export drops the rest.
handoff/content/questions.csv
handoff/content/questions.xlsx
# Same reasoning, and more so: the calendar re-deals every future day on each content
# run, so this one is stale the next time anything is added. Regenerate with
# `pipeline/export_schedule.py`. It also contains every answer for the whole
# calendar, which is a second reason not to have it sitting in the repo.
handoff/content/schedule-master.csv
handoff/content/schedule-master.xlsx
